psd_import-layer-effects-drop-shadow-and-tip = Layer effects (drop shadow and so on) are not evaluated. The layer pixels are imported as they are, so the composite differs from the PSD's merged image
psd_import-the-smart-object-s-source-tip = The smart object's source data is not kept. The layer pixels are imported as they are
psd_import-the-text-data-is-not-tip = The text data is not kept. The layer pixels are imported as they are
psd_import-vector-masks-are-not-evaluated-tip = Vector masks are not evaluated. The layer pixels are imported as they are, so the composite changes
psd_import-gradient-and-pattern-fill-settings-tip = Gradient and pattern fill settings are not kept. The layer pixels are imported as they are
psd_import-this-adjustment-layer-cannot-be-tip = This adjustment layer cannot be imported. It has no pixels, so the whole layer is dropped
psd_import-unsupported-blend-modes-become-normal-tip = Unsupported blend modes become Normal
psd_import-blend-if-is-not-evaluated-tip = Blend If is not evaluated. The composite changes
psd_import-fill-opacity-is-multiplied-into-tip = Fill opacity is multiplied into the layer opacity. With some blend modes it differs slightly from Photoshop
psd_import-this-setting-is-not-evaluated-tip = This setting is not evaluated. The composite may change
psd_import-this-mask-setting-is-not-tip = This mask setting is not evaluated. The mask pixels are imported as they are
psd_import-a-mask-default-other-than-tip = A mask default other than 0 or 255 is set to the nearer of the two. Outside the mask rectangle the look changes
psd_import-the-mask-has-a-rectangle-tip = The mask has a rectangle but no pixel values, so it becomes a mask of its default value only. Inside the rectangle the look may change
psd_import-pixels-outside-the-canvas-cannot-tip = Pixels outside the canvas cannot be kept and are cut off
psd_import-layers-with-a-missing-or-tip = Layers with a missing or duplicate ID get a new ID. Nothing is matched by name
psd_import-colors-are-not-converted-pixel-tip = Colors are not converted; pixel values are imported as they are
psd_import-the-aspect-ratio-is-not-tip = The aspect ratio is not kept; pixels are imported as squares
psd_import-the-imported-project-s-composite-tip = The imported project's composite compared with the merged image saved in the PSD
psd_import-the-composite-was-not-compared-tip = The composite was not compared with the merged image, so it is unverified
psd_import-a-layer-without-all-rgb-tip = A layer without all RGB channels cannot be imported and is dropped
